# Create Helper Rule

Use when creating utility helpers, services, or cross-cutting logic in masterfabric_core.

## Directory Structure

```
lib/src/helper/[helper_name]/
├── [helper_name]_helper.dart     # Main helper
└── [optional_supporting_files].dart
```

## Helper Patterns

### 1. Stateless Helper (no DI)

```dart
/// 🗂️ [HelperName] - [Brief description]
///
/// Usage:
/// ```dart
/// final result = MyHelper.doSomething();
/// ```
class MyHelper {
  static String doSomething() => 'result';
}
```

### 2. Singleton Helper (@lazySingleton)

```dart
import 'package:injectable/injectable.dart';

/// 🛠️ [HelperName] - [Description]
@lazySingleton
class MyHelper {
  Future<String?> doSomething() async {
    try {
      debugPrint('🔍 MyHelper: Doing something...');
      // logic
      debugPrint('✅ MyHelper: Success');
      return result;
    } catch (e) {
      debugPrint('❌ MyHelper: Error: $e');
      return null;
    }
  }
}
```

### 3. Injectable Helper (transient)

```dart
@injectable
class MyHelper {
  // New instance each time via GetIt.I<MyHelper>()
}
```

## DI Annotations

| Use Case | Annotation |
|----------|------------|
| Singleton, shared state | `@lazySingleton` |
| New instance per use | `@injectable` |
| Eager singleton | `@singleton` |

## Emoji Logging

Use in debugPrint:
- 🚀 Initialization
- ✅ Success
- ❌ Error
- ⚠️ Warning
- 🔍 Debug
- 📊 Data/Stats

## Platform Safety

```dart
Future<String?> getPlatformData() async {
  if (kIsWeb) {
    debugPrint('⚠️ Not available on web');
    return null;
  }
  try {
    return await _fetchFromNative();
  } catch (e) {
    debugPrint('❌ Error: $e');
    return null;
  }
}
```

## Export

Add to `lib/src/core.dart`:

```dart
export 'helper/[helper_name]/[helper_name]_helper.dart';
```

## Code Generation

```bash
dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs
```

## Checklist

- [ ] Placed in `lib/src/helper/[helper_name]/`
- [ ] Class name ends with `Helper`
- [ ] @lazySingleton or @injectable as appropriate
- [ ] Try-catch with safe defaults
- [ ] Emoji debug logging
- [ ] Platform checks for native code
- [ ] Exported in core.dart
